      "id": "5507a893-e24e-4966-9707-2f6cdfbc02ec",
      "text": "If the same question $P$ is posed at intervals $\\Delta t$ short on the scale of leakage out of the yes subspace, the effective Hamiltonian becomes $PHP$: evolution within the subspace proceeds, but leakage out of it is blocked. This is the quantum Zeno effect.",
